{"suttaId":"thag3.12","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1262,1271],"vripara":"252"},"segments":{"thag3.12:0.4":"Uttarapālattheragāthā","thag3.12:1.1":"“Paṇḍitaṃ vata maṃ santaṃ, alamatthavicintakaṃ;","thag3.12:1.3":"Pañca kāmaguṇā loke, sammohā pātayiṃsu maṃ.","thag3.12:2.1":"“Pakkhando māravisaye, daḷhasallasamappito;","thag3.12:2.3":"Asakkhiṃ maccurājassa, ahaṃ pāsā pamuccituṃ.","thag3.12:3.1":"“Sabbe kāmā pahīnā me, bhavā sabbe padālitā [vidālitā (sī. pī. aṭṭha.)];","thag3.12:3.3":"Vikkhīṇo jātisaṃsāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag3.12:3.5":"… Uttarapālo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
